@authHost = http://localhost:8081
@campaignHost = http://localhost:8082
@apiHost = http://localhost:5000

### 1. Rust Auth Service - Health Check
GET {{authHost}}/health
Accept: application/json

### 2. Rust Campaign Engine - Health Check
GET {{campaignHost}}/health
Accept: application/json

### 3. Rust Auth - User Login & Issue JWT Token
# @name login
POST {{authHost}}/auth/token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "tenant_id": "tenant-1"
}

### Capture JWT Token from Login response
@authToken = {{login.response.body.access_token}}

### 4. Rust Auth - Cedar ABAC Authorization Evaluation
POST {{authHost}}/auth/authorize
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "token": "{{authToken}}",
  "action": "CreateUrunCommand",
  "resource": "Urun"
}

### 5. .NET WebAPI - Get Categories
GET {{apiHost}}/api/Kategori?PageIndex=0&PageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 6. .NET WebAPI - Get Products List (Resource Server)
GET {{apiHost}}/api/Urun?PageIndex=0&PageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 7. .NET WebAPI - Get Cart / Sepet
GET {{apiHost}}/api/Sepet?PageIndex=0&PageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 8. .NET WebAPI - Get Orders / Siparis
GET {{apiHost}}/api/Siparis?PageIndex=0&PageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 9. .NET WebAPI - Get Payments / Odeme
GET {{apiHost}}/api/Odeme?PageIndex=0&PageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 10. .NET WebAPI - Get Shipments / Kargo
GET {{apiHost}}/api/Kargo?PageIndex=0&PageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 11. .NET WebAPI - Get Coupons / Kupon
GET {{apiHost}}/api/Kupon?PageIndex=0&PageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 12. .NET WebAPI - Get Reviews / Degerlendirme
GET {{apiHost}}/api/Degerlendirme?PageIndex=0&PageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 13. Rust Campaign Engine - Evaluate Discount & Rules
POST {{campaignHost}}/calculate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "total_amount": 3450.00,
  "currency": "USD",
  "user_tier": "VIP",
  "items_count": 1,
  "coupon_code": "INDIRIM20"
}
